  "title": {
   "en": "Suki to Iuniha Mada Osanai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "好きと言うにはまだ幼い"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Hikari, a high school sophomore who’s never been interested in love, has recently found joy in Sparkle Animals, a four-player survival game. One day, she decides to attend her first offline meetup. Everyone is as kind as she imagined, but Ichio-kun, who seemed sweet and innocent in the game, is tall, cool, and a bit intimidating in real life... Yet, as they part ways, he smiles and says, “I’m glad I got to meet you, Hikari-chan”—making her heart skip a beat.\""
  },
